  "limitations": [
    "Independent unbuilt source queue only: one real root commit, nine files and no model or new-scene delivery. Payload contains report images32and36, one Cold As Ice official cover, identity,39-image textual grouping, two limited old-source comparison link/hash records, review and manifest.",
    "The actual report images are1192x671 and official cover1007x630. These are public report/cover pixels, not native decoded video frames; within-video times and highest decoded quality are unknown. Only32and36are included from the39grouping records. Other images, social/person/UI pixels and diagnostic contact sheets are not in the payload.",
    "Frozen metadata distinguishes2024-08-03performance,2024-08-04report and2024-08-13Cold As Ice/Past Lives upload. Official BV1Zb421E7sW identifies remastered August3livestream material. A later upload does not demonstrate later stage reuse.",
    "The32gold circular stage and36audience-ring stage are queued separately within one limited lead: static-state compatibility is unproved, and a second stable wide-side structural baseline is missing. Person-closeup33and effect35do not supply that baseline. No hidden circumference or complete environment is inferred.",
    "The frozen review records old red-gold#15and star-awards#13comparison observations plus arcade#85exclusion, but the old comparison pixels are external to this package and not reverified here. This bounded review is not exhaustive all-old-scene pixel deduplication. No new-scene eligibility or absence of other sources is claimed.",
    "Five directed queries and technical limitations are preserved as review text. Existing blocked playback/endpoint attempts are not retried. No external research, downloaded scripts, production files, geometry or images are generated by the archive worker.",
